From: Silt OS maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] dash: gate printf floating point conversions for Silt

Neva does not yet preserve an EL0 floating-point context. Keep the integer and
string POSIX printf surface usable and fail explicitly for floating directives
until that process ABI exists.

--- a/src/bltin/printf.c
+++ b/src/bltin/printf.c
@@ -44,0 +45 @@
+#ifndef SILT_NO_FLOAT_PRINTF
@@ -45,0 +47 @@
+#endif
@@ -259,0 +262,3 @@
+#ifdef SILT_NO_FLOAT_PRINTF
+				error("%s: floating point directive unavailable", start);
+#else
@@ -262,0 +268 @@
+#endif
@@ -536,0 +543 @@
+#ifndef SILT_NO_FLOAT_PRINTF
@@ -555,0 +563 @@
+#endif
